From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the shell hears the desk's sound

Registers the mixer's member of the control protocol: an `audio` event,
a DomicileAudioEvent carrying the desk's outputs and inputs
(DomicileAudioDevice), its streams playing and recording
(DomicileAudioStream) and its sound cards (DomicileAudioCard), with a
device's ports and a card's profiles as DomicileAudioChoice.

The event, its init dictionary, the four interfaces, the mojom members
and the mixer's six requests are new files and edits under src/; what
cannot be is a name in a generated-bindings list. Its context is the domicile block as 0077
leaves it, for the reason 0045 gives.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`, and `guard-control-arrival.sh` fires the
`audio` name in a real engine.
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_modules.gni | 12 ++++++++++++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni       | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

